  "ruleText": "Pos 1501.05 Application Deadline. To be considered an on-time application, the application shall be submitted to the commission office and received by the commission by July 1 at:\n\nPostsecondary Education Commission\n\n3 Barrell Court, Suite 300\n\nConcord, NH 03301-8543\n\nSource. #9677, eff 3-13-10",
